    "message": "Guidelines require serum creatinine and eGFR every 12 months for patients on TDF. Patient has been on TDF since March 2023. The most recent creatinine was drawn on 2025-11-05, 78 days before this visit. If no creatinine was checked between March 2024 and November 2025, the 12-month monitoring interval was exceeded. The clinician's plan does not include any renal function monitoring today despite the patient presenting with abdominal pain, a symptom potentially related to TDF toxicity.",
